Port of _patches/typescript/001-cmd-tsgo-main.patch (tsc/cmd/tsc/main.go) to tsrs.

Go imports the Effect hook packages from cmd/tsc/main.go, so their init()s run before main. The tsrs executable is a
binary crate, which effect-tsgo's Rust binary (crates/ets_tsrs) cannot call into: this makes tsrs_cli a library too
(lib.rs includes main.rs, whose `main` becomes public), so that crates/ets_tsrs registers the hook crates and then
calls `tsrs_cli::main`. The `tsrs` binary target is unchanged.

Not ported yet: the `--effect-cli-diagnostics` command (etsdiagnostics.Run); crates/ets_tsrs adds it once
etsdiagnostics is ported.

